<sect1 id="chapter6_1autotoc_md153_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter6_1autotoc_md153">
<title>Chapter summary</title><para>Stage 4 is successful when loader behavior is predictable and compatibility-driven. A minimal but strict ABI yields safer extension loading. Do not collapse plugin and library APIs into a single vague module type.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>Keep<sp/>the<sp/>loader<sp/>small,<sp/>explicit,<sp/>and<sp/>easy<sp/>to<sp/>test.</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
